; The demos stay in @default on purpose: they are compiled against the public
; API only, so building them catches API drift (they are how MessageBox and
; selection_model changes were validated). They are built exe-only rather than
; byte+exe, halving the number of binaries produced.
(executables
 (names hello kitchen_sink drawing_canvas table_view_demo workbench_demo declarative_todo drag_drop_demo)
 (modes exe)
 (libraries camlqt6))